;Custom dialogue settings, custom code
;※※※※※※※※※※※※※※※※※※※※※※※※※※
;made it as a way to speed up the update process and separate simple flag updates from various customization options
;note: options start from 1!

@KOJO_OPTION_K92
CALL KOJO_OPTION_ITEM("Change traits to match the dialogue better", 1, "cond", (ABL:92:12 < 3 || ABL:92:13 < 3 || TALENT:92:11 < 0 || TALENT:92:70 < 1))
;process the input portion

@KOJO_OPTION_K92_RESULT_1
PRINTFORML 설정하면 기교와 봉사정신은 Lv3으로 가고, [Docile]은 제거되며, [Enjoys Pleasure]가 추가된다.
PRINTFORML ([Docile]은 나중에 돌아온다)
PRINTFORML
CALL ASK_YN
SELECTCASE RESULT
	;いいよ
	CASE 0
		CFLAG:92:1001 = 1
		PRINTFORML 특성이 변경될 것이다.
		;変更内容はここに記述
		SIF ABL:92:12 < 3
			ABL:92:12 = 3
		SIF ABL:92:13 < 3
			ABL:92:13 = 3
		TALENT:92:11 = 0
		TALENT:92:70 = 1
		PRINTFORMW
		;だめよ
	CASEELSE
		CFLAG:92:1001 = -1
		PRINTFORML 특성은 변경되지 않는다.
		PRINTFORMW
ENDSELECT
;※※※※※※※※※※※※※※※※※※※※※※※※※※
;"ENCOUNTER"系イベント（エクストラ構文）
